tool.type.name = Akkharakaraṇaṃ
tool.type.description = Phusitvā tattha akkharasantharaṃ ārabhatha, atha vā vijjamānaṃ phusitvā sampādetha. Tasmiṃ vivaṭe sati karaṇaṃ aparivattitāni taḷitāni gaṇhāti (akkharāni taḷanāgamanena pesetha); niṭṭhāpiyamāne santharaṃ chāyārūpaṃ katvā sampādanaṃ pidahati.

